// Concrete instance model for CRFTypesCon.
// IMPORTANT: For CRFTypesCon, element definitions embed a concrete Location,
// i.e. use `FirstPos fp1 ()` (or similar) instead of just `fp1`.

// Elements
Plate plate1 (FirstPos fp1 ())
Beam beam1 (FirstPos fp2 ())
Beam beam2 (FirstPos fp3 ())

// Locations referenced by actions in behavior trees
PositionOnRail pr1 ()
PositionOnRail pr2 ()
PositionOnRail pr3 ()

// Agents / tools
Robot r1 (PositionOnRail rp1 () ur10)
Robot robot1 (PositionOnRail rp1b () ur10)
VacGripper vg1 (FirstPos fp1vg () True)



